  doc_orientation.tflite
    Text orientation classifier (PP-LCNet, PaddleClas "text_image_orientation"),
    as packaged by RapidOrientation https://github.com/RapidAI/RapidOrientation
    Copyright RapidAI and the PaddlePaddle Authors. Apache License 2.0.
    Modified: converted from ONNX to TensorFlow Lite with onnx2tf, weights quantized to 8 bit.

